WEBVTT

00:01.870 --> 00:04.440
<i>A dream? Where'd this come from?</i>

00:04.440 --> 00:06.070
Hey, brat.

00:06.070 --> 00:08.330
You got a problem or something?

00:08.330 --> 00:11.100
<i>Ah, yeah, that's how it usually went, huh?</i>

00:11.100 --> 00:13.150
<i>Next, he's gonna hit me,</i>

00:13.150 --> 00:17.620
<i>while Mom just looks at me apologetically.</i>

00:17.930 --> 00:20.570
<i>Damn... Why now of all times?</i>

00:20.570 --> 00:22.900
<i>I was trying to appreciate Yuna's—</i>

00:23.930 --> 00:25.000
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:25.000 --> 00:26.480
<i>That hurt!</i>

00:28.380 --> 00:30.430
<b><i>HE'S DEAD</i></b>

00:32.070 --> 00:34.250
Dead, dead, another day dead

00:34.250 --> 00:36.180
Head, arms, and legs gonna 
fall off any minute now

00:36.180 --> 00:38.310
Whole body hollowed out, dry as a desert...

00:38.310 --> 00:41.060
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

00:40.190 --> 00:41.080
<b>THE</b>

00:41.080 --> 00:41.620
<b>LEGEN</b>

00:41.620 --> 00:42.120
<b>DARY</b>

00:42.120 --> 00:42.580
<b>HERO</b>

00:42.580 --> 00:43.080
<b>IS</b>

00:43.040 --> 00:43.540
<b>DEAD</b>

00:47.910 --> 00:49.580
Spending every day like 
you're in a casket, trapped

00:49.580 --> 00:51.650
Ready for another night 
like the dead, collapsed

00:51.650 --> 00:53.400
Yeah, living like a carcass
 with just your "life" intact...

00:53.400 --> 00:55.690
Who wouldn't want a way 
to con themselves out of that?

00:55.690 --> 00:57.780
Breaking away from ideas of "should do"

00:57.780 --> 00:59.700
to live for yourself—
that's lots of fun, too...

00:59.700 --> 01:01.630
Otherwise you're just being a mark...

01:01.630 --> 01:02.740
And who wants that?

01:02.740 --> 01:06.250
You and I, we're just corpses

01:06.250 --> 01:10.520
Pawns of some faceless necromancer

01:10.520 --> 01:14.260
From one marionette to another, I say...

01:14.260 --> 01:20.430
How about we cut our strings together?

01:20.430 --> 01:21.230
Let's get dancing!

01:21.230 --> 01:23.270
Dead, dead, another day dead

01:23.270 --> 01:25.340
Head, arms, and legs gonna 
fall off any minute now

01:25.340 --> 01:27.360
Whole body hollowed out, dry as a desert...

01:27.360 --> 01:29.190
Ha, ha, ha, ha!

01:29.190 --> 01:31.250
Dead, dead, we're already dead

01:31.250 --> 01:33.280
Gonna shake off this 
mortal coil any minute now

01:33.280 --> 01:35.240
You just gotta laugh a life like this off!

01:35.240 --> 01:37.740
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

01:37.740 --> 01:41.580
I tell you, this world makes life so hard

01:41.580 --> 01:45.460
What can you do but dance 
the whole night through?

01:45.460 --> 01:48.720
Even if I collapse and my body decays

01:48.720 --> 01:53.500
that doesn't mean I'm rotten 
all the way down to my soul!

01:57.010 --> 01:59.970
<b>Episode 9</b>

01:57.010 --> 01:59.970
<b>Into the Legendary Hero's Past</b>

01:58.630 --> 01:59.970
<i>Okay, that settles that.</i>

01:59.970 --> 02:02.400
<i>I'm definitely me from a few years ago,</i>

02:02.930 --> 02:04.910
<i>and this is definitely Elvania.</i>

02:04.910 --> 02:07.890
<i>Am I back in the past?</i>

02:07.890 --> 02:09.850
<i>What triggered this?</i>

02:09.850 --> 02:12.820
<i>All I did was stroke Yuna's thighs a little.</i>

02:12.820 --> 02:14.320
<i>Actually, wait a sec...</i>

02:14.320 --> 02:17.480
<i>I've never really gotten
to stroke Yuna's thighs before.</i>

02:17.780 --> 02:19.530
<i>Could that be what did it?</i>

02:20.970 --> 02:22.320
<i>Yeah, nah.</i>

02:22.320 --> 02:26.150
<i>Whatever the case, I better find 
a way to get back to normal fast.</i>

02:26.150 --> 02:28.710
<i>I gotta save Yuna, after all.</i>

02:28.710 --> 02:31.420
<i>Hang on. Do I </i>really<i> hafta get back?</i>

02:31.420 --> 02:34.850
<i>I've got more than ten years 
before Yuna becomes a devil.</i>

02:34.850 --> 02:37.630
<i>What if I use that time 
to come up with a plan?</i>

02:39.130 --> 02:40.870
<i>Yeah, I'll do just that!</i>

02:40.870 --> 02:44.880
<i>Meaning I can enjoy this miraculous
time slip to its fullest!</i>

02:48.390 --> 02:50.600
Oh, good day.

02:53.440 --> 02:55.090
<i>No need to fear!</i>

02:55.090 --> 02:58.530
<i>Anyone'd see this as
just a harmless child's prank!</i>

02:58.530 --> 03:00.740
Oh, good day.

03:01.220 --> 03:01.950
Huh?

03:01.950 --> 03:05.410
Hey, you're supposed to get mad 
or grossed out or something!

03:05.410 --> 03:06.410
Good day.

03:06.410 --> 03:07.910
Hello there.

03:08.410 --> 03:09.640
What's up, kiddo?

03:09.640 --> 03:10.890
How ya doing, buddy?

03:10.890 --> 03:12.740
<i>Don't ask me how I'm doing!</i>

03:12.740 --> 03:14.040
<i>The hell is going on?</i>

03:18.910 --> 03:20.840
<i>Why isn't anyone reacting?</i>

03:20.840 --> 03:22.590
<i>Damn it!</i>

03:22.590 --> 03:25.930
<i>What the hell is going on here?!</i>

03:25.930 --> 03:29.400
<i>Basking in thighs to my heart's
 content should be heaven,</i>

03:29.400 --> 03:32.650
<i>but if the girls don't react, 
they might as well be radishes!</i>

03:32.650 --> 03:36.730
<i>I can't take this kind of lonely life here.</i>

03:36.730 --> 03:37.610
<i>Wait.</i>

03:37.610 --> 03:40.570
<i>My parents were still acting like themselves.</i>

03:41.690 --> 03:42.910
<i>It was today...</i>

03:43.690 --> 03:47.990
<i>The rare occasion my dad beat us
in front of his mercenary buddies</i>

03:47.990 --> 03:49.830
<i>was the day I first met Yuna!</i>

03:50.250 --> 03:51.980
<i>If I'm right about this...</i>

03:53.250 --> 03:56.090
What are you doing out here all by yourself?

03:58.430 --> 03:59.840
Waiting for you, Yuna.

03:59.840 --> 04:01.550
Huh? For me?

04:01.550 --> 04:03.820
Uh, I mean, my dad hit me!

04:03.820 --> 04:05.510
I don't wanna go home now.

04:05.510 --> 04:07.010
<i>I knew it!</i>

04:07.010 --> 04:10.270
<i>The only folks acting weird are 
people I didn't really know!</i>

04:11.330 --> 04:13.370
<i>Hang on. If this was how we met,</i>

04:13.370 --> 04:15.590
<i>how did Yuna already know who I was?</i>

04:17.170 --> 04:19.730
I'll stay with you, Touka.

04:22.360 --> 04:24.430
<i>Well, never mind the reason.</i>

04:24.430 --> 04:26.450
<i>Yuna saying that was what—</i>

04:27.390 --> 04:28.660
<i>Wait. At this age, I could...</i>

04:28.990 --> 04:30.890
Hey, does staying with me forever mean

04:30.890 --> 04:34.500
you'll let me worship those thighs 
of yours even after we grow up?

04:35.620 --> 04:37.210
Yeah, sure.

04:37.210 --> 04:38.420
<i>Too easy!</i>

04:38.420 --> 04:40.640
With stockings on, of course.

04:40.640 --> 04:42.880
I don't know what that means, but sure.

04:44.440 --> 04:45.590
<i>That's right.</i>

04:45.590 --> 04:49.600
<i>At this age, I could slowly raise Yuna 
into my dream version of her!</i>

04:50.930 --> 04:52.840
You must be hungry.

04:52.840 --> 04:54.630
I'll go get us some food.

04:54.630 --> 04:55.520
Wait here!

04:55.520 --> 04:57.840
<i>Damn it! I almost had her!</i>

04:57.840 --> 04:59.480
Knock it off already!

04:59.480 --> 05:01.810
Making me make all those weird promises...

05:01.810 --> 05:04.850
Don't sully my precious memories, you idiot!

05:04.850 --> 05:05.980
Pervert!

05:06.410 --> 05:07.580
No way...

05:08.780 --> 05:10.250
That voice...

05:10.690 --> 05:13.200
N-No, wait! Don't come any closer!

05:13.700 --> 05:14.820
Yuna!

05:16.550 --> 05:18.880
What are you all teary-eyed about?

05:18.880 --> 05:20.940
Are you really Yuna?

05:20.940 --> 05:22.710
Yeah, as far as I can tell...

05:23.160 --> 05:25.130
Hey, don't start crying!

05:25.130 --> 05:26.270
Shut up!

05:26.270 --> 05:29.270
I'm just more of a crybaby in this kid body.

05:29.270 --> 05:30.760
Seriously, what are you doing here?

05:30.760 --> 05:32.060
And why are you naked?

05:32.060 --> 05:34.350
That's what I'd like to know.

05:34.870 --> 05:36.940
But one thing I can say for sure

05:36.940 --> 05:40.940
is that this is a fake past created by magic.

05:41.370 --> 05:43.650
A fake past?

05:45.570 --> 05:48.030
<b>Stockings</b>

05:45.570 --> 05:48.030
<b>Stockings</b>

05:45.570 --> 05:48.030
<b>Touka's
Shirt</b>

05:45.570 --> 05:48.030
<b>Stockings</b>

05:45.940 --> 05:48.030
I can breathe a little easier now!

05:48.030 --> 05:50.140
Don't you rip my stockings!

05:50.140 --> 05:51.650
You stole my shirt too, damn it!

05:51.650 --> 05:54.080
At least you've still got pants.

05:54.080 --> 05:57.450
Why not just borrow some 
clothes from someone?

05:57.450 --> 05:58.420
Because...

05:58.840 --> 06:00.380
I can't touch them.

06:00.380 --> 06:03.090
I've been following you all this time,

06:03.090 --> 06:05.410
but nobody seems to realize I'm here,

06:05.410 --> 06:07.940
and I can't touch anything in this world.

06:07.940 --> 06:11.560
But you can touch me and stuff I'm wearing?

06:12.690 --> 06:14.220
Wait, you were following me?

06:14.220 --> 06:19.770
Yes, and I saw <i>all</i> the depraved things 
you subjected the townspeople to.

06:19.770 --> 06:21.270
I-It wasn't like that!

06:21.270 --> 06:23.730
I was just trying to unravel 
the mystery of this world!

06:23.730 --> 06:27.240
It was <i>definitely</i> like that,
you perverted scumbag!

06:28.430 --> 06:30.730
Whatever's going on here,

06:30.730 --> 06:35.170
it certainly seems to be
magical in origin, like you said.

06:35.170 --> 06:36.330
Hello there.

06:36.720 --> 06:39.750
That man... He looks like Dr. Leland.

06:39.750 --> 06:42.700
And that's Isaac's head on Siruela's body.

06:42.700 --> 06:43.710
Gross!

06:44.060 --> 06:45.170
Hang on.

06:45.170 --> 06:49.720
The people I know well 
both look and act like themselves.

06:49.720 --> 06:53.680
But the people I barely know 
don't have real personalities,

06:53.680 --> 06:57.310
and anyone whose appearance
I can't even remember becomes

06:57.310 --> 06:58.890
some combo of people I do.

06:58.890 --> 07:01.350
In other words, this is...

07:01.350 --> 07:05.690
It's not the past, but rather
a world made from my memories.

07:05.690 --> 07:08.770
Does that mean you're a memory too?

07:08.770 --> 07:10.400
I'm definitely me!

07:10.400 --> 07:13.810
Because my soul is also still in my body,

07:10.400 --> 07:15.490
<b>Yuna's Soul</b>

07:10.680 --> 07:15.490
<b>Yuna's Body</b>

07:10.930 --> 07:15.490
<b>Touka's Soul</b>

07:13.810 --> 07:15.490
maybe I got sucked in too?

07:15.490 --> 07:17.110
I can see that.

07:17.110 --> 07:19.650
But if we ain't really back in the past,

07:19.650 --> 07:23.650
there's a good chance that time's passing
here just like in the real world.

07:23.650 --> 07:25.360
I better get outta here.

07:25.360 --> 07:28.040
Good idea, but how will you do it?

07:30.500 --> 07:31.950
What if I leave the city...

07:32.370 --> 07:35.510
and go somewhere I'd never been?

07:36.550 --> 07:37.380
By the way...

07:37.380 --> 07:40.510
How'd you know my name 
the day we first met?

07:40.510 --> 07:42.050
Did you fall in love at first—

07:42.050 --> 07:43.520
Nothing like that!

07:43.520 --> 07:47.240
You were always all
bruised up and by yourself,

07:47.240 --> 07:50.490
so I asked around about you
and decided I was going to help.

07:50.490 --> 07:53.410
Is that why you promised to stay
with me the first time we met?

07:53.410 --> 07:54.780
That's pretty over the top.

07:54.780 --> 07:56.910
Just reaching out on a whim like that...

07:56.910 --> 07:58.850
What am I, some abandoned cat?

07:58.850 --> 08:01.750
Why do you have to interpret it 
in such a negative way?

08:02.280 --> 08:04.460
Still, thanks.

08:05.340 --> 08:07.160
S-Sure...

08:09.370 --> 08:11.170
What the heck is this?

08:11.170 --> 08:14.050
There's nothing here. It's all white.

08:16.340 --> 08:18.680
I think I can pass through.

08:20.090 --> 08:22.530
I'll shout if it's dangerous,
so pull me back.

08:22.530 --> 08:23.510
Okay.

08:25.430 --> 08:28.100
Hey, Touka! You're pulling too hard!

08:28.100 --> 08:29.400
I'm gonna get yanked—

08:31.250 --> 08:33.320
Why am I naked again?

08:33.320 --> 08:36.500
Is this the day I first
invited you to our house?

08:36.500 --> 08:37.420
Yeah.

08:38.280 --> 08:41.100
<i>This was the first time I met Milly.</i>

08:41.100 --> 08:46.750
<i>I lied and bragged I'd beaten up bears and
gorillas, which is what kicked off our duels.</i>

08:47.590 --> 08:48.960
I gotta hit the can.

08:48.960 --> 08:50.800
Where are you going?

08:50.800 --> 08:52.670
This isn't the way to the bathroom!

08:52.670 --> 08:55.260
I'm gonna jump back into that white space!

08:56.050 --> 08:58.390
Again? But it didn't get you out last time!

08:58.390 --> 09:00.060
It's all about time!

09:00.060 --> 09:02.470
Jumping in forced an advance in time!

09:02.470 --> 09:05.800
If I keep doing it,
we'll reach the present eventually!

09:12.230 --> 09:16.700
I never thought I'd be running a marathon
through the world of my memories...

09:16.700 --> 09:18.280
Where are we?

09:18.280 --> 09:20.330
Five years ago.

09:20.330 --> 09:22.480
The day I left Elvania, I'd say.

09:22.480 --> 09:25.750
Dad wanted to hit up the northern 
continent to loot the raided cities.

09:27.250 --> 09:30.210
You didn't come to see me off then.

09:30.620 --> 09:32.340
We'd had a fight, I think.

09:32.340 --> 09:37.070
Because you swapped all the socks 
in my dresser for stockings!

09:37.070 --> 09:39.340
Hey, I'd forgotten I did that!

09:39.340 --> 09:44.680
I really regretted being stubborn 
and not seeing you off, though.

09:44.680 --> 09:46.270
Y-You mean it?

09:46.270 --> 09:48.370
O-Of course not!
I only regretted it a little!

09:48.370 --> 09:51.440
I totally forgot about you 
the very next day!

09:51.440 --> 09:53.880
Now, let's move on to 
the next entry in your past!

09:55.680 --> 09:57.700
Is this the northern continent?

09:59.160 --> 10:03.160
This was the day my dad disappeared
and I got sick.

10:03.160 --> 10:06.010
My mom went off to find medicine

10:06.010 --> 10:07.000
and died...

10:07.830 --> 10:09.860
I might still make it!

10:09.860 --> 10:11.170
Mom!

10:11.170 --> 10:12.750
Maybe I can save her!

10:12.750 --> 10:15.210
Touka, this isn't reality!

10:28.820 --> 10:30.660
You came...

10:31.730 --> 10:39.790
I forgot to give you this letter 
Yuna left for you...

10:40.590 --> 10:42.070
I'm sorry.

10:42.710 --> 10:47.940
I looked the other way when such 
awful things were happening to you...

10:49.030 --> 10:51.330
I was a terrible mother.

10:52.750 --> 10:56.130
Perhaps I have no right to say this...

10:57.870 --> 11:02.680
But I really do love you, Touka.

11:06.470 --> 11:07.530
Damn it...

11:08.180 --> 11:10.820
This was four years ago already.

11:11.740 --> 11:15.140
Give me a damn break...

11:20.750 --> 11:22.110
Now it's a battlefield?!

11:22.110 --> 11:23.620
Yeah, so be careful!

11:26.660 --> 11:29.620
What happens if we die here?

11:30.570 --> 11:32.920
What's with the grim expression?

11:32.920 --> 11:34.580
N-Nothing.

11:37.050 --> 11:39.110
What is that sound?

11:39.110 --> 11:41.510
That's right. This was the day...

11:41.510 --> 11:44.470
that all of humanity stopped fighting.

11:45.480 --> 11:47.520
The day the Gates of Hell opened.

11:51.270 --> 11:52.690
You saw it?

11:52.690 --> 11:53.850
Yeah.

11:55.100 --> 11:56.820
We better scram too!

12:03.700 --> 12:06.430
Nothing in particular happened on this day.

12:06.930 --> 12:09.040
Let's hurry up and advance more.

12:09.040 --> 12:10.970
<i>Something</i> must have happened!

12:10.970 --> 12:13.870
Everything we've been through
so far was of significance.

12:13.870 --> 12:16.040
I mean, where did that wound come from?

12:16.040 --> 12:19.640
Oh, yeah, I got kinda whacked
by a devil on this day.

12:20.170 --> 12:21.760
But it's no big deal, okay?

12:21.760 --> 12:22.830
Touka!

12:22.830 --> 12:27.710
I never even imagined you were 
going through all this...

12:27.710 --> 12:32.810
When you made it back, I took it for granted
and blamed you for being gone.

12:32.810 --> 12:34.170
Why...

12:34.570 --> 12:36.650
Why didn't you tell me?

12:36.650 --> 12:38.270
Weren't we childhood friends?

12:38.270 --> 12:40.740
How was I supposed to...

12:41.740 --> 12:44.200
I know everything.

12:44.200 --> 12:47.010
Even infected with 
the devil-conversion spell,

12:47.010 --> 12:50.240
I can still see and hear what's
 going on around me.

12:50.830 --> 12:56.420
I think my consciousness is the only thing
that escaped the magical hold on my soul.

12:56.420 --> 12:58.540
So I heard your conversation with Milly.

12:58.540 --> 13:03.920
That you came to save us three years ago.

13:04.280 --> 13:10.910
And yet I... I was always going on and on 
about the hero and chewing you out.

13:10.910 --> 13:14.890
Even though you barely
even made it back to us...

13:14.890 --> 13:16.590
I'm sorry.

13:16.590 --> 13:20.400
The one who truly saved me...
It was you, Touka.

13:21.340 --> 13:24.320
The hell are you apologizing for?

13:24.320 --> 13:26.910
It was the hero who saved you.

13:26.910 --> 13:29.370
And I only came back 'cause I wanted to.

13:31.030 --> 13:34.460
I mean it when I said nothing 
really happened on this day.

13:34.900 --> 13:38.440
It was just the day I read your letter.

13:40.610 --> 13:42.550
Yeah, fine, whatever.

13:43.300 --> 13:47.070
Gonna die in some unknown land,
all alone and with nothing...

13:47.070 --> 13:50.650
A shitty end to a shitty life.

13:53.420 --> 13:55.980
Hey, yeah. I never read this, did I?

13:57.280 --> 14:01.200
"I'll make up with you 
when you get back," huh?

14:02.440 --> 14:05.090
Wait a minute! Is that it?!

14:05.090 --> 14:08.320
No "I have faith that you'll return to me"?

14:08.320 --> 14:11.800
Or "Even if we're far apart, 
I'll never forget you"?!

14:14.710 --> 14:17.290
Even at the bitter end, I don't get forgiven?

14:17.290 --> 14:19.120
What a load of crap.

14:19.690 --> 14:22.230
How the hell am I supposed to die like this?

14:24.300 --> 14:27.110
Boy, that pissed me off, y'know?

14:27.110 --> 14:30.550
W-Well, I had no idea you'd 
been through all this...

14:30.900 --> 14:34.500
But it was so like you, Yuna,
that it made me miss home.

14:34.500 --> 14:39.020
I don't know if I could've recovered
if not for what you wrote.

14:39.730 --> 14:43.240
Yuna, you say that I saved you,

14:43.770 --> 14:45.190
but between this day,

14:45.610 --> 14:47.610
and the day we first met,

14:47.610 --> 14:49.990
and you coming on this journey with me...

14:50.650 --> 14:53.830
It's always been <i>you</i> saving <i>me</i>.

14:56.110 --> 14:58.450
So, with that being the situation and all,

14:58.450 --> 15:01.840
I'm pretty sure I should be
telling you not to apologize.

15:01.840 --> 15:04.750
That's on me for not actually
being there to save you for real.

15:04.750 --> 15:08.340
Seriously, that stupid letter saving me
bugged me so much

15:08.340 --> 15:11.220
that I never wanted to bring it up.

15:18.550 --> 15:19.820
A high-rank devil?!

15:19.820 --> 15:22.560
Were you attacked by a high-rank
devil today, too?

15:22.560 --> 15:25.120
No, I've never seen that thing before.

15:25.120 --> 15:25.520
What?

15:25.520 --> 15:27.910
Honestly, my dear Touka Scott.

15:27.910 --> 15:30.860
A man talking to himself 
is so boring to watch.

15:30.860 --> 15:36.660
There's nothing I love better 
than peeking into human memories.

15:36.660 --> 15:39.750
It's a pleasure I just can't get in Hell!

15:39.750 --> 15:42.990
Yet all you're doing is talking to yourself.

15:42.990 --> 15:46.630
I need you to play your role,
or else this is no fun for me.

15:46.980 --> 15:50.090
So this world is your doing, huh?

15:50.980 --> 15:52.950
Precisely!

15:52.950 --> 15:55.800
It's a bit like a dream world, you see.

15:55.800 --> 15:59.770
In the real world, 
you're fast asleep at my side.

16:00.140 --> 16:01.850
Once I tire of their memories,

16:01.850 --> 16:04.680
I typically come inside
to devour my victim.

16:04.680 --> 16:07.980
But I've never gotten bored 
so quickly before.

16:07.980 --> 16:09.780
<i>Damn it. This is bad.</i>

16:09.780 --> 16:12.450
<i>Why'd the spellcaster have to 
be a high-rank devil?</i>

16:12.450 --> 16:14.070
Let's run, Yuna!

16:14.830 --> 16:17.370
A pity there's no way out.

16:17.740 --> 16:20.340
The only way to escape is to defeat me,

16:20.340 --> 16:22.580
but that's certainly not possible, is it?

16:23.370 --> 16:25.540
What a polite little devil!

16:25.540 --> 16:27.630
Consider my destination set now.

16:28.050 --> 16:29.520
<i>I'm gonna keep sprinting...</i>

16:29.520 --> 16:32.190
<i>until I reach my finest hour!</i>

16:36.900 --> 16:39.410
<i>Sion the hero could take out 
a high-rank devil.</i>

16:39.410 --> 16:40.620
Hey, hero!

16:40.620 --> 16:42.830
A high-rank devil is on the way.

16:42.830 --> 16:44.390
Go beat it, okay?!

16:44.390 --> 16:45.350
Huh?

16:45.350 --> 16:49.460
Why should <i>I</i> do the bidding 
of a little piece of trash like you?

16:49.460 --> 16:50.320
<i>Who's that?!</i>

16:50.320 --> 16:51.320
Damn it!

16:51.320 --> 16:54.220
I was a fool to ask
that twisted freak for help!

16:54.220 --> 16:57.120
<i>The devil's altering Touka's memories now?!</i>

17:01.750 --> 17:04.170
The legendary hero was 
defeated that easily?!

17:04.170 --> 17:05.210
We can't stay here.

17:05.210 --> 17:06.300
Let's move on!

17:08.170 --> 17:10.050
Why'd we have to wind up <i>here</i>?!

17:13.510 --> 17:14.760
Not good!

17:16.550 --> 17:17.550
Kyle!

17:17.550 --> 17:19.220
Yeah, he could do the job!

17:21.560 --> 17:24.190
They're nothing but memories.

17:24.190 --> 17:27.850
Before me, this world's creator, they are...

17:27.850 --> 17:28.810
Powerless!

17:28.810 --> 17:29.770
Powerless!

17:29.770 --> 17:30.730
Powerless!

17:34.250 --> 17:36.750
Good, we finally made it here.

17:36.750 --> 17:38.540
And I'm as strong as I was then.

17:38.540 --> 17:40.580
Now I can fight him!

17:41.900 --> 17:44.490
You wish to fight me on your best day?

17:44.490 --> 17:46.960
A wise decision.

17:46.960 --> 17:49.830
Don't tell me you can steal 
that power from me, too?

17:49.830 --> 17:52.420
If only I could.

17:52.420 --> 17:56.630
Alas, I can only manipulate
products of pure memory.

17:57.600 --> 18:02.560
I cannot tamper with your own
memories of yourself.

18:02.560 --> 18:06.530
There's so much I can't do. 
It's really quite pathetic.

18:06.530 --> 18:12.480
Souls are all I can eat, and to eat, 
I must attack in the world of memories.

18:12.480 --> 18:17.410
And while I'm inside your memories, 
I'm defenseless in the real world.

18:17.410 --> 18:21.440
If a third party kills me or
you're awakened from your slumber,

18:21.440 --> 18:23.790
the spell breaks automatically.

18:23.790 --> 18:26.710
Yeah, talk about a ton of weaknesses.

18:26.710 --> 18:30.170
Are you telling me all this 'cause 
you've given up on our fight?

18:30.170 --> 18:32.750
Oh, not at all!

18:32.750 --> 18:36.130
I'm saying that even given such weaknesses,
you cannot defeat me.

18:36.130 --> 18:38.450
One reason for that is because,

18:38.450 --> 18:43.140
in the real world, my dear friends 
are fighting your companions!

18:43.140 --> 18:47.560
In other words, there's no one 
to save you on the outside.

18:47.560 --> 18:49.290
Another reason is because...

18:49.290 --> 18:54.020
you simply don't have the power 
to inflict a single scratch upon me.

18:54.020 --> 18:57.760
Oh, please. I'm in Sion the hero's body.

18:57.760 --> 18:59.530
Go on and try it, then.

19:00.860 --> 19:02.280
I'm on it!

19:02.280 --> 19:03.240
No need...

19:03.240 --> 19:04.700
to even ask!

19:05.950 --> 19:07.160
I can't hit him!

19:07.890 --> 19:09.750
It's all pointless, you see.

19:09.750 --> 19:13.000
This world is a creation of my magic,

19:13.000 --> 19:16.460
meaning I can read
all your thoughts in advance.

19:17.260 --> 19:18.460
In that case...

19:18.460 --> 19:20.740
I'll have to face you without thinking.

19:22.910 --> 19:23.460
Wuh?

19:23.460 --> 19:25.680
He really did stop thinking!

19:27.210 --> 19:29.660
That is indeed how to fight me...

19:29.660 --> 19:32.100
if only you were capable of it.

19:32.100 --> 19:34.680
I'm so disappointed.

19:34.680 --> 19:40.370
The man who killed the legendary 
hero led such a sad, average life.

19:40.370 --> 19:46.090
I pity Sion for falling at the hands
of someone so dull.

19:47.910 --> 19:51.120
I'm getting pretty sick 
of that stupid laugh of yours.

19:51.120 --> 19:55.390
Barging into someone's mind
and writing their life off as dull?

19:55.390 --> 19:58.090
Sounds like you're the dull one!

19:58.090 --> 20:03.050
Some asshole who's never held anyone dear
would never understand.

20:03.390 --> 20:06.070
Even if I had the chance
to live another life,

20:06.070 --> 20:08.430
I'd still choose this one!

20:09.060 --> 20:11.550
'Cause a life without Yuna and the others

20:11.550 --> 20:13.980
would <i>really</i> be a shitty life to me!

20:14.840 --> 20:16.440
Well, then...

20:17.240 --> 20:18.900
That's a pity.

20:18.900 --> 20:22.530
Because that life is now over!

20:24.100 --> 20:24.990
<i>Eh?</i>

20:24.990 --> 20:26.230
<i>That action just now...</i>

20:26.230 --> 20:28.450
<i>I didn't see it coming.</i>

20:28.830 --> 20:32.230
I knew it. He can't see me at all.

20:32.230 --> 20:33.410
Gotcha.

20:33.410 --> 20:41.380
His magic can't account for the weird 
situation of two souls in the same body.

20:41.380 --> 20:43.090
<i>Two souls?</i>

20:43.490 --> 20:46.480
<i>I thought perhaps he'd just gone mad,</i>

20:46.480 --> 20:49.560
<i>but is there truly someone else inside him?</i>

20:49.930 --> 20:51.350
I'm gonna get on your back.

20:52.310 --> 20:55.830
<i>Her thighs... And they're wrapped around me?!</i>

20:55.830 --> 20:59.250
Don't give one thought to how 
you move your arms, all right?

20:59.250 --> 21:00.080
R-Right.

21:00.080 --> 21:03.320
It's gonna be hard for me to think 
about much right now anyway.

21:03.320 --> 21:04.780
Here we go!

21:05.740 --> 21:06.870
You see that?

21:06.870 --> 21:09.730
Behold our first real liaison together!

21:09.730 --> 21:11.700
Don't say things that 
could be misinterpreted!

21:12.150 --> 21:14.290
<i>What in the world?</i>

21:14.290 --> 21:17.170
<i>The one I can't detect is in control?</i>

21:17.440 --> 21:21.140
<i>Still, he should be cognizant
of what he's doing.</i>

21:21.140 --> 21:23.090
<i>If I read that...</i>

21:23.770 --> 21:25.580
<i>Thighs... Thighs...</i>

21:25.580 --> 21:28.050
<i>Thighs... Thighs... Thighs...</i>

21:28.050 --> 21:32.170
<i>Thighs... Thighs... Thighs... Thighs...</i>

21:29.100 --> 21:36.020
<b>Thighs...</b>

21:29.100 --> 21:36.020
<b>Thighs...</b>

21:29.570 --> 21:36.020
<b>Thighs...</b>

21:32.160 --> 21:36.020
<b>Thighs...</b>

21:32.170 --> 21:35.710
<i>His entire mental process 
is overwhelmed by thighs!</i>

21:33.160 --> 21:36.020
<b>Thighs...</b>

21:36.020 --> 21:39.260
<i>What a truly base creature.</i>

21:39.260 --> 21:41.270
<i>Humans are such brilliant beings,</i>

21:41.270 --> 21:43.780
<i>yet this one is trash beneath 
even a low-rank devil!</i>

21:44.160 --> 21:45.770
<i>I-I've got to escape.</i>

21:45.770 --> 21:47.980
<i>I don't want to die in memories like—</i>

21:51.160 --> 21:54.910
We may never see each other again after this.

21:54.910 --> 21:56.000
Huh?

21:56.000 --> 21:57.620
Hey, screw that.

21:57.620 --> 22:00.080
This time, I'm gonna save you for sure.

22:00.480 --> 22:03.050
So don't you worry. Just sit tight.

22:03.530 --> 22:05.750
Okay. I'll be waiting.

22:16.860 --> 22:19.080
This is reality... right?

22:21.790 --> 22:22.820
Yuna?!

22:23.410 --> 22:25.200
N-No way! You can see me?

22:25.200 --> 22:25.940
Yeah.

22:25.940 --> 22:28.450
So am I looking at your consciousness now?

22:28.450 --> 22:31.260
Hey! Don't just touch me like that!

22:31.260 --> 22:32.780
Sir Touka!

22:32.780 --> 22:35.240
Hey, you guys are okay?

22:35.240 --> 22:38.570
The enemy said the workshop 
was attacked, so...

22:38.570 --> 22:41.210
Indeed. So were you attacked as well?

22:41.210 --> 22:44.080
We just defeated our assailants.

22:44.080 --> 22:46.420
Heck, what was I so worried about?

22:46.420 --> 22:48.380
In other news, Touka...

22:48.380 --> 22:50.650
We finished repairs 
to the enchanted carriage!

22:50.650 --> 22:53.350
Now we can set course for Elvania!

22:53.350 --> 22:57.310
<b>Meanwhile</b>

22:58.110 --> 23:01.400
"Run your own investigations"?

23:01.940 --> 23:05.640
That piece of shit! I should've 
had him put to death!

23:05.640 --> 23:08.650
What's the matter, Dame Siruela?

23:09.240 --> 23:12.160
<b>Rosale Charis
Court Magician</b>

23:12.160 --> 23:17.030
I asked the hero to investigate where 
the astral form you witnessed flew off to,

23:17.030 --> 23:18.660
but he turned me down.

23:19.050 --> 23:23.670
Ah, you mean the necromancer 
who gave Leland access to necromancy?

23:23.670 --> 23:27.400
I've taken my own measures on that front.

23:27.400 --> 23:31.200
I suspect they've located the enemy
base right around now...

23:32.570 --> 23:35.920
The elites of my Order of Magical Warriors.

23:37.060 --> 23:40.020
<b>14 hours until Yuna and the others become devils</b>
